====== DogeEdit ======
DogeEdit is a random text editor that is just like micro text editor.

= Exiting
  To exit from the editor, hit Ctrl-X.

= Going somewhere
  Ctrl-G for going to anyline (use the side bar if you want to refer)
  Ctrl-F for finding any piece of text

= File operations
  Ctrl-S for saving your file (opening any name auto creates if doesn't
      exist)
  Ctrl-O for opening an existing file,
  Ctrl-N for creating a new file